WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.990
A car has broken down on a flat road.

2
00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:06.110
You lean on it and push
as hard as you can.

3
00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.940
It is a heavy family car,
far more massive than you.

4
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:13.530
Now give a light wheelbarrow
exactly the same push.

5
00:00:13.580 --> 00:00:14.730
Ignore friction.

6
00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.560
Same force, very different masses.

7
00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.560
How much more slowly
does the car speed up?

8
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:25.200
In this mission, you'll find a car's
acceleration when its engine drives it forward

9
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:27.660
and resistive forces push back.

10
00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.900
Then you'll connect a block
on a table to a hanging mass,

11
00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:33.060
by a string over a pulley.

12
00:00:33.110 --> 00:00:37.150
Your mission: work out how much
more slowly the car speeds up.
